:Namespace Lib
⍝ The shared library.  Docs: lib/README.md
⍝
⍝ Each part is its own file in this folder: Str.apln, Stats.apln, Data.apln,
⍝ Sys.apln, Fmt.apln, Err.apln, Date.apln, Log.apln. Fixing this file loads
⍝ every other .apln here as Lib.<Name>, so one line gets you all of them
⍝ (the `dyalog` command mounts lib/ at /apl-lib):
⍝     ⎕FIX'file:///apl-lib/Lib.apln'
⍝     Lib.Str.Trim '  hi '   ⋄   Lib.Stats.Mean 1 2 3
⍝
⍝ To add a part, add a :Namespace file to this folder: it is picked up
⍝ automatically. Fix this file again to reload everything after an edit.
⍝ Under `dyalog test`, Lib is already loaded for the code being tested.

    ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
    Dir←{0::'/apl-lib/' ⋄ ⊃1⎕NPARTS 4⊃5179⌶⍵}⎕THIS      ⍝ the folder this file was fixed from
    Files←(⊃0 1(⎕NINFO⍠1)Dir,'*.apln')~⊂Dir,'Lib.apln'
    Files←Files[⍋↑Files]
    Parts←{2⊃⎕NPARTS ⍵}¨Files                            ⍝ 'Data' 'Date' 'Err' …
    Loaded←{⎕FIX'file://',⍵}¨Files                       ⍝ (statements here must be assignments)
:EndNamespace
